0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 222.0 Tm (* Not a central fundraiser, new nonprofit, political rally, or overnight endurance challenge.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 203.6 Tm (* Not a requirement to sleep outdoors; participation can be indoor or daytime.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 185.2 Tm (* Not a competition for who can tolerate the most discomfort.) Tj ET
