0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.0 255.4 Tm (Adults / mixed ages | "Three perspectives, one neighborhood") Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.0 242.0 Tm (40 - 50 minutes. Discuss a resident concerned about public spaces, a neighbor without housing, and a) Tj ET
