0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.0 170.0 Tm (with a short discussion using the reflection prompts.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.0 151.6 Tm (For every age group: never pressure anyone to disclose their own housing circumstances. A participant in) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.0 138.2 Tm (the room may be experiencing homelessness now.) Tj ET
