0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 526.0 Tm (* Recruit adult helpers and follow youth-safety policies.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 507.6 Tm (* Confirm accessible toilets, weather options, first aid, emergencies, and reasonable accommodations.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 489.2 Tm (* Select materials; ask local partners about optional supplies.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 48.0 470.8 Tm (November 1 - 7 | Confirm) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 452.4 Tm (* Confirm venue, permission, speaker, and participant instructions.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 434.0 Tm (* Make sure families have consent and supervision information.) Tj ET
