0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 360.4 Tm (* Brief volunteers and facilitators.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 342.0 Tm (* Host the learning program; finish with reflection, not a hardship contest.) Tj ET
