0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 286.8 Tm (* Share anonymized participation totals and learning feedback, not private stories.) Tj ET
0.17 0.25 0.30 rg BT /F1 9.35 Tf 1 0 0 1 58.0 268.4 Tm (* Discuss what future actions or conversations the group wishes to pursue.) Tj ET
